    "Moving stopped. Android’s data stays where it was." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pemindahan dihentikan. Data Android tetap di tempatnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never in it: Android’s data and your apps’ files, the keys Avo uses for ADB, your fingerprints and your accounts. Email addresses, account names, tokens and locations are taken out of the logs, and your home folder shows as ~." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tidak pernah disertakan: data Android dan file aplikasi Anda, kunci yang dipakai Avo untuk ADB, sidik jari Anda, dan akun Anda. Alamat email, nama akun, token, dan lokasi dihapus dari log, dan folder rumah Anda ditampilkan sebagai ~."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No screen of this Mac refreshes in step with %lld fps, so motion can judder a little." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
