          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "aplikasi butuh versi Android yang lebih baru"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the app was updated, but its game data (OBB) could not be copied to Android: %@. Install it again to copy it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "aplikasinya sudah diperbarui, tetapi data game-nya (OBB) tidak bisa disalin ke Android: %@. Instal lagi untuk menyalinnya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the files were copied, but Android does not list Google Play services and the Play Store." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "file sudah disalin, tetapi Android tidak mencantumkan Layanan Google Play dan Play Store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the install did not finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "instalasinya tidak selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the package is not signed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "paket tidak ditandatangani"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has only %@ free. When it is full, Android waits until you free some space on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” hanya punya %2$@ ruang kosong. Jika penuh, Android menunggu sampai Anda mengosongkan sebagian ruang di sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is formatted as %@. Avo is made for APFS drives; format it as APFS in Disk Utility if Android has trouble with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” diformat sebagai %2$@. Avo dibuat untuk drive APFS; format sebagai APFS di Utilitas Disk jika Android bermasalah dengannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is formatted as ExFAT. It has no sparse files, so Android’s data disk takes its full size on the drive, and no journal, so unplugging the drive while Android runs can damage it. APFS is better: format the drive as APFS in Disk Utility." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” diformat sebagai ExFAT. Format ini tidak punya file sparse, jadi disk data Android langsung memakai seluruh ukurannya di drive, dan tidak punya jurnal, jadi mencabut drive saat Android berjalan bisa merusaknya. APFS lebih baik: format drive sebagai APFS di Utilitas Disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is formatted as MS-DOS (FAT), which can’t hold files over 4 GB, and Android’s data disk is bigger. Format the drive as APFS in Disk Utility." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” diformat sebagai MS-DOS (FAT), yang tidak bisa menyimpan file lebih dari 4 GB, sedangkan disk data Android lebih besar. Format drive sebagai APFS di Utilitas Disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is formatted as Mac OS Extended, which has no sparse files: Android’s data disk takes its full size on the drive. APFS keeps it as small as what Android stores." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” diformat sebagai Mac OS Diperluas, yang tidak punya file sparse: disk data Android langsung memakai seluruh ukurannya di drive. APFS membuatnya hanya sebesar yang disimpan Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is read-only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” hanya bisa dibaca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” was disconnected while Android used it. Connect it again, then start Android." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” terputus saat dipakai Android. Sambungkan lagi, lalu jalankan Android."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Pause when idle” must be Never or 5, 15 or 30 minutes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Jeda saat tidak dipakai” harus Tidak pernah atau 5, 15, atau 30 menit."
          }
        }
      }
